  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">EWDWS - EXPERIENCE WITH PERFORMANCE BASED TRANSFERS</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Decentralization of WSS service provision is widespread yet central governments often remain the principal source of external financing. Many have posited that for such public funding to be used efficiently, the instruments and programs through which such transfers are made should adhere to performance criteria.  OBA is but one approach and it is transaction based.</narrative>
  </description>
